flowchart TD
    subgraph Presentation [表現層]
        CLI[PowerShell CLI\n腳本介面]
        Notebook[Jupyter Notebook\n探索性分析]
        Report[Markdown 報告\n自動生成]
    end
    
    subgraph Application [應用層]
        Pipeline[DataIngestionPipeline\n管道編排器]
        ScoringEngine[RiskScoringEngine\n風險評分引擎]
        ValidationEngine[HistoricalValidator\n歷史驗證引擎]
        VisualizationEngine[VisualizationEngine\n視覺化引擎]
    end
    
    subgraph Domain [領域層]
        Earthquake[EarthquakeRecord\n地震紀錄實體]
        Precursor[PrecursorRecord\n前驅觀測實體]
        Baseline[Baseline\n基線值物件]
        RiskScore[RiskScore\n風險分數物件]
        WeightConfig[WeightConfig\n權重配置]
    end
    
    subgraph Infrastructure [基礎設施層]
        CSVReader[CSVReader\nCSV 讀取器]
        JSONHandler[JSONHandler\nJSON 處理器]
        PythonBridge[PythonBridge\nPython 呼叫橋接]
        FileSystem[FileSystem\n檔案系統存取]
        GitHubActions[GitHubActions\nCI/CD 執行環境]
    end
    
    subgraph External [外部系統]
        CWA_API[CWA 地震目錄 API]
        NSRC_GNSS[NSRC GNSS/CORS\nGPS 變形資料]
        MOI_Magnetic[國防部地磁觀測站]
        WRA_Groundwater[水資源署地下水監測]
        FORMOSAT[FORMOSAT-5/COSMIC\n離電層 TEC]
        CWA_Weather[CWA 氣象站\n氣壓、雨量]
        NARI_Tidal[海洋研究院潮汐模型]
        SeismoStrain[地震研究所應變儀]
    end
    
    %% 相依關係
    CLI --> Pipeline
    Notebook --> ScoringEngine
    Notebook --> ValidationEngine
    Report --> ValidationEngine
    
    Pipeline --> Earthquake
    Pipeline --> Precursor
    Pipeline --> Baseline
    Pipeline --> RiskScore
    Pipeline --> WeightConfig
    Pipeline --> ScoringEngine
    Pipeline --> ValidationEngine
    Pipeline --> VisualizationEngine
    
    ScoringEngine --> RiskScore
    ScoringEngine --> WeightConfig
    ScoringEngine --> Baseline
    ScoringEngine --> Precursor
    
    ValidationEngine --> Earthquake
    ValidationEngine --> RiskScore
    ValidationEngine --> WeightConfig
    
    VisualizationEngine --> RiskScore
    VisualizationEngine --> PythonBridge
    
    Pipeline --> CSVReader
    Pipeline --> JSONHandler
    Pipeline --> FileSystem
    ScoringEngine --> CSVReader
    ScoringEngine --> JSONHandler
    ValidationEngine --> CSVReader
    VisualizationEngine --> CSVReader
    VisualizationEngine --> FileSystem
    
    CSVReader --> CWA_API
    CSVReader --> NSRC_GNSS
    CSVReader --> MOI_Magnetic
    CSVReader --> WRA_Groundwater
    CSVReader --> FORMOSAT
    CSVReader --> CWA_Weather
    CSVReader --> NARI_Tidal
    CSVReader --> SeismoStrain
    
    GitHubActions --> CLI
    GitHubActions --> FileSystem
    
